@startuml state-bey-combat
title State Machine: one Bey during a match (Match Server) [P]
[*] --> AWAITING_LAUNCH
AWAITING_LAUNCH --> LAUNCHING : LAUNCH_WINDOW opens (5 s)
LAUNCHING --> ACTIVE : RELEASE (launchRps = RPS(presses))
state ACTIVE {
  [*] --> STABLE
  STABLE --> STAGGERED : hit (N > 0)\ncontrol authority reduced 0.3 s
  STAGGERED --> STABLE : stagger expires
  STABLE --> WOBBLING : spinRps < 25
  WOBBLING --> STABLE : Second Wind raises spin
  STABLE --> SKILL_ACTIVE : skill accepted\n(gauge full, cooldown ok, uses < 3,\nspin >= 20, not opening 3 s)
  SKILL_ACTIVE --> STABLE : duration ends (cooldown starts)
}
ACTIVE --> ELIMINATED_BURST : lockIntegrity <= 0\nor critical burst (L <= 50)
ACTIVE --> ELIMINATED_OVER : left arena / pocket >= 0.5 s
ACTIVE --> ELIMINATED_XTREME : left via Xtreme zone
ACTIVE --> ELIMINATED_SPIN : spinRps < 8
ACTIVE --> WINNER : last remaining
ELIMINATED_BURST --> SPECTATING
ELIMINATED_OVER --> SPECTATING
ELIMINATED_XTREME --> SPECTATING
ELIMINATED_SPIN --> SPECTATING
SPECTATING --> [*]
WINNER --> [*]
note right of ACTIVE
  Disconnected competitor: top keeps being simulated
  with zero input during grace [P, OQ-GP-05].
end note
@enduml
